      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck; some tables add jokers.',
      equipment: 'Cards and central play pile/discard area.',
      dealing: 'Each player receives 3 face-down table cards, 3 face-up table cards on top, and 3 hand cards. Remaining cards form stock.',
    },
    turnFlow: 'Players take turns playing cards (or sets) equal to or higher than the top of the pile. If unable or unwilling, they pick up the whole pile. While stock remains, players refill hand back to three cards. Special cards commonly include 2 (wild/reset), 10 (burn pile), and four-of-a-kind pile clear. After hand cards are gone, players use face-up table cards, then unknown face-down cards.',
